# Onboarding copy (F-28): the empty-state strings of docs/UX/ONBOARDING.md that B13 does not define.
# Keys are lowercase semantic words joined by hyphens. Each value says what happened and what the
# user can do next, matching the `Next action` column of the `## Empty states` table.
# The stems of the four activation emails are still declared new in ONBOARDING.md; they join this
# file when their templates ship (T-0082) and are deliberately not defined here yet.

empty-onboarding-profile = No profile details are saved yet. Fill in the fields and continue.
empty-readiness = No readiness score is shown yet because there is no domain or no check data. Add a website so the checks can run.
empty-alerts = No alert rule exists yet. Create one so the team hears about the events that matter.
empty-team = No invitations have been sent yet. Invite a teammate, or skip this optional step.
empty-reports = No reports exist yet. Create a report when you need a summary you can share.
empty-privacy = No export or deletion request is open. Request an export to receive a copy of your data.
